   "answer": "INC-2041 lasted about 60 minutes, while INC-2047 lasted about 97 minutes, making the latter longer. The root cause of INC-2041 was connection-pool exhaustion in the payment-gateway service, caused by two low-risk changes (CHG-1042 reduced the PayFlex connection pool size and CHG-1051 deployed a new fraud-scoring model) [S3, S4]. The root cause of INC-2047 was a database migration (CHG-1047) that built an index on the ledger_entries table without the CONCURRENTLY option, locking the table for writes and stalling withdrawals [S2, S6].",
